# SMD Linux - minimal base system
#
# Only what a bootable, updatable Debian system needs.  Package managers,
# documentation tools and build toolchains are intentionally absent; users
# install what they need with APT.
linux-image-amd64
initramfs-tools
# 1.6 replaces the bare cursor between the boot menu and the desktop with
# a loading screen.  plymouth lives in the initramfs and hands over to the
# session once X is up; it stops there and stays stopped.
plymouth
# The text label modules (label-pango, label-freetype) live in a separate
# package.  Without it Image.Text in the theme draws nothing and the screen
# shows only the gradient - plymouthd logged "Could not load module
# .../label-pango.so" in run 44977852165.
plymouth-label
systemd
systemd-timesyncd
dbus
dbus-x11
polkitd
pkexec
sudo
ca-certificates
openssl
tzdata
locales
console-setup
keyboard-configuration
lsb-release
zram-tools
nano
less
file
pciutils
usbutils
